    ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c l\u0103n. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P16 \u2014 hai l\xE0n ng\u1EAFn
    kh\xF4ng kh\xF3a nhau, c\xF9ng d\u1EABn v\u1EC1 s\xE2n tho\xE1t.\nRecovery: M\u1ED7i
    l\xE0n c\xF3 t\xFAi d\u1EEBng r\u1ED9ng; m\u1ED9t bi l\xF9i l\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng
    k\xE9o bi kia v\u1EC1 \u0111\u1EA7u ho\u1EB7c g\xE2y kh\xF3a \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng"
